{%- comment -%}
  AJ Story — the short version, on the homepage.

  A SCREEN, NOT THE MACHINE. The About page gets the full CRT: beige shell,
  chin, power lamp, swivel base. This one borrows only the glass — dark panel,
  scanlines, phosphor eyebrow — and stops there. The monitor is that page's
  signature and it stays worth the trip; repeating the whole thing here would
  spend it, and a second beige box on a homepage that already carries the
  Yoink, the Bin and two nav grids is one object too many.

  IT SITS LAST, after Recent Yoinks. Somebody who has scrolled past the deal,
  the bin and the categories has already decided the shop is interesting —
  "who are you people" is the question they have left. Putting it higher costs
  the Yoink its position, and the Yoink is what the whole site is pointed at.

  THE COPY IS THE SHORT VERSION, deliberately. Alex wrote three lengths; the
  medium one is on /pages/about-us and this is the homepage cut. They must not
  be edited into each other — the whole point is that this one is skimmable and
  ends on a link.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
-%}

<div
  class="aj-story color-{{ s.color_scheme }}"
  style="padding-block-start: {{ s.padding-block-start }}px; padding-block-end: {{ s.padding-block-end }}px;"
  {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="aj-story__inner page-width">
    <div class="aj-story__screen" style="--aj-story-phosphor: {{ s.phosphor }}; --aj-story-screen: {{ s.screen_color }};">
      {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-story__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.body != blank -%}
        <div class="aj-story__body rte">{{ s.body }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.cta_text != blank -%}
        <a class="aj-story__cta" href="{{ s.cta_link | default: '/pages/about-us' }}">
          {{- s.cta_text | escape -}}
          <span class="aj-story__caret" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .aj-story__screen {
    /* Same two knobs as the About page's monitor, defaulted the same, so the
       two surfaces cannot drift into different greens. */
    --aj-story-phosphor: #5cf08a;
    --aj-story-screen: #0b100c;

    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    color: #d6f5e0;

    /* Scanlines in the BACKGROUND, never as an overlay — an overlay drags
       contrast down on every other row of text. */
    background-color: var(--aj-story-screen);
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgb(255 255 255 / 0.035) 0 1px,
      transparent 1px 3px
    );
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 70px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.55),
      0 0 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--aj-story-phosphor) 16%, transparent);
  }

  .aj-story__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-family: "Ohpixel", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--aj-story-phosphor);
    text-shadow: 0 0 14px color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 45%, transparent);
  }

  /* Archivo, for the same reason as the About page: Ohpixel loses its grid in
     sentences, and this is three paragraphs. */
  .aj-story__body {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .aj-story__body p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgb(214 245 224 / 0.72);
  }

  /* The first paragraph carries the hook, so it is set brighter and larger
     than the two that follow it. */
  .aj-story__body p:first-child {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #d6f5e0;
  }

  .aj-story__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .aj-story__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--aj-story-phosphor) 55%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--aj-tile-radius, 8px);
    color: var(--aj-story-phosphor);
    font-family: "Ohpixel", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .aj-story__cta:hover {
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--aj-story-phosphor) 14%, transparent);
    }
  }

  /* Nudges on hover rather than sliding on a loop: motion that answers an
     action, not motion that runs at somebody trying to read. */
  .aj-story__caret {
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .aj-story__cta:hover .aj-story__caret {
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aj-story__caret {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .aj-story__screen {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .aj-story__body p:first-child {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Full width so the tap target is not a small pill on a wide screen. */
    .aj-story__cta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Story",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The homepage cut of the origin story. The longer version lives on the About page — keep them different lengths rather than editing one into the other."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Our story" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Story",
      "default": "<p>A couple of '90s kids who missed the dot-com boom, grew up through every recession and pandemic on the calendar, and decided to make the most of the hand we've been dealt. Also: two guys that had a lot of fun working together until one of them moved off — so, to keep the bromance alive, we started a store.</p><p>The Yoink is one genuinely cool, slightly random, worth-having find every single day, dropped at a price that feels a little illegal and gone by tomorrow. We're not in it for the yacht (a canoe, tops). We're in it because hunting down great stuff and handing you the deal beats a real job by a mile.</p><p>Raccoons do it with dog food. We do it with better taste. Some days the Yoink is for you, some days it's a penguin thing that isn't — that's the game. Watch the drops and yoink the good stuff before it's gone. ⚡</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_text", "label": "Button", "default": "Read the whole thing" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_link", "label": "Button link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Appearance" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "phosphor", "label": "Phosphor", "default": "#5cf08a" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "screen_color", "label": "Screen", "default": "#0b100c" },
    { "type": "color_scheme", "id": "color_scheme", "label": "Color scheme", "default": "scheme-1" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Padding" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-start", "label": "Top", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 40 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-end", "label": "Bottom", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 60 }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "AJ Story" }]
}
{% endschema %}
